<title>USA: BT Securities wins $44 mln Ocean Cty, N.J., BANs.</title>
<headline>BT Securities wins $44 mln Ocean Cty, N.J., BANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Securities said it won $43.74 million of Ocean County, N.J., bond anticipation notes (BANs).</p>
<p>The coupon was 4 1/4 percent and a net interest cost (NIC) of 3.7566 percent. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
